te sensing and in situ observations  and also really importantly given what  I've just talked about the need to  integrate species level approaches and  macro ecological modeling approaches to  this integration of remote sensing and  in situ observations so so both are  really important they're highly  complementary and we've got to get  smarter about how we use them in  conjunction with each other thank you  thanks for keeping on time gives us time  for one or two questions but in a minute  of soup so you can already come up Mac  and get started but the questions  property  can you call me  if I had 10 minutes now we can be  holding a few min so so we can talk  afterwards yeah that that takes quite a  while very happy
 

